WEBVTT

00:05.230 --> 00:08.240
I knew that it was massive 
from a distance, and yet...

00:08.820 --> 00:11.410
This is the pride of all Quefto:
our central furnace!

00:11.840 --> 00:15.730
All the metal for the 
village gets refined here.

00:15.730 --> 00:19.090
You can never have too much 
iron or steel, after all.

00:20.240 --> 00:22.650
Come on, the workshop is this way.

00:24.750 --> 00:26.100
What is that...?

00:30.520 --> 00:32.980
I thought it a statue,
 but what exactly is it?

00:32.980 --> 00:34.610
Some kind of giant?

00:34.920 --> 00:38.420
It's... not just a statue, is it?

00:39.140 --> 00:41.390
Th-This is...

00:41.390 --> 00:45.020
...frankly, way too advanced!

00:41.390 --> 00:45.020
...frankly, way too advanced!

01:01.000 --> 01:08.590
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

02:17.520 --> 02:19.370
Say, Veor...

02:23.050 --> 02:27.130
You're not simply surprised, are you?

02:27.130 --> 02:29.370
Well, no.

02:29.680 --> 02:33.110
Kimaki, the elders, 
the dwarves we met before...

02:33.110 --> 02:35.510
They seem friendly and 
kind enough, and yet...

02:36.030 --> 02:40.010
Do you honestly feel no fear 
seeing this level of technology?

02:40.620 --> 02:42.890
The land being so bountiful, 
they may not need to...

02:43.220 --> 02:46.520
but when I think of them using 
any of this for conflict...

02:46.880 --> 02:52.780
You really think so? I don't see 
any need for concern, myself.

02:53.400 --> 02:56.280
Because of your long history with them?

02:56.510 --> 03:01.540
No. I'd say it's Quefto nature 
to not desire such things.

03:03.840 --> 03:07.940
I'm sure it'll be clear to you after 
we meet the person we're here to see.

03:12.740 --> 03:14.020
Elder Balhath.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.780
Ah, Thundering Voice.

03:17.780 --> 03:20.400
You showed up right when 
you said you would.

03:20.400 --> 03:23.180
Shame you had to get past 
the fire dragon to do it.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.680
Elder Balhath...

03:25.680 --> 03:29.440
Elder Balhath

03:26.090 --> 03:28.910
He was one of the three 
dwarven elders, I believe.

03:29.440 --> 03:32.030
I made it back, Grandpa!

03:33.960 --> 03:37.920
I ran into them during fire dragon patrol!

03:37.920 --> 03:40.450
Is that right?

03:40.450 --> 03:44.200
E-Elder Balhath, it's good
to see you again.

03:45.440 --> 03:47.980
Likewise, Crystal Helmet.

03:47.980 --> 03:52.800
It's been since your debut, right?
 Good to see you doing well.

03:53.680 --> 03:59.720
By the way, the armor that you came in 
with is being looked over by apprentices.

03:59.980 --> 04:01.960
This is the good stuff!

04:01.960 --> 04:04.640
Willpower-responsive armor 
made out of steel...

04:04.640 --> 04:07.980
Those westerners are absolute perverts!

04:07.980 --> 04:10.600
Chrome-plated willpower conducting wires!

04:10.600 --> 04:12.970
I bet they came up with this 
because they didn't have the

04:12.970 --> 04:14.980
bio-materials necessary 
for a more organic method!

04:15.260 --> 04:18.750
It'll be as good as new in the morning.

04:18.750 --> 04:22.620
Between that and the new helmet... 
I don't know how to thank you enough.

04:22.620 --> 04:24.990
It's fine, it's fine!

04:24.990 --> 04:30.480
Not to sound ungrateful, but I'm 
curious about the new helmet.

04:36.180 --> 04:38.010
Here it is!

04:38.350 --> 04:40.970
Gave it everything I got 
and made sure

04:40.970 --> 04:44.010
this "Crystal Helmet" 
would be enchanted, too!

04:44.980 --> 04:46.020
That's a helmet?

04:46.630 --> 04:48.190
It sure is.

04:48.890 --> 04:53.910
I asked for the best, 
so I don't doubt it, but...

04:53.910 --> 04:56.900
You're not going to say this is the 
"best fashion accessory," are you?

04:57.430 --> 04:59.770
Function over fashion!

04:59.770 --> 05:01.780
Just put it on.

05:03.700 --> 05:06.650
I may notice the difference 
once it's on...

05:11.980 --> 05:13.670
What do you think?

05:17.120 --> 05:20.680
I appreciate how light and 
non-disruptive it is, but...

05:21.610 --> 05:23.990
Are you sure this isn't 
just a hair accessory?

05:23.990 --> 05:27.060
Well, maybe when you're 
taking it easy, like now.

05:27.060 --> 05:31.610
Try putting your war face on! 
And channel your willpower through it!

05:31.610 --> 05:32.560
Oh, right.

05:36.240 --> 05:39.560
Channel willpower, in the 
state of mind I have during...

05:45.540 --> 05:46.450
Battle!

05:49.200 --> 05:50.700
Something opened up?!

05:55.260 --> 05:58.660
I can't even touch it! 
Or more like, my hands are repelled!

05:58.660 --> 06:00.520
As if there's some sort of force field!

06:03.470 --> 06:07.720
In lieu of crystal, this enchanted 
helmet deploys a willpower force field!

06:07.720 --> 06:11.070
I call it... The Silver Flower!

06:11.070 --> 06:13.600
One of my greatest creations!

06:13.600 --> 06:15.530
The Silver Flower?

06:17.540 --> 06:19.110
And now it's closed.

06:19.110 --> 06:22.740
It's supposed to, when you're 
not focusing your willpower.

06:22.740 --> 06:26.220
The forcefield's range and strength 
depends on your willpower,

06:26.220 --> 06:30.620
and from what I just saw, it should be 
able to deflect a fire dragon's claws.

06:31.000 --> 06:32.920
This really is amazing...

06:32.920 --> 06:35.870
A-Amazing doesn't begin to describe it...

06:35.870 --> 06:40.320
And when accounting for 
everything else we've seen...

06:41.000 --> 06:44.080
They have the metallurgy 
to refine mythril,

06:44.080 --> 06:46.820
on top of such advanced technology!

06:46.820 --> 06:50.160
To say nothing of the creativity 
beyond the pale to enchant it!

06:50.160 --> 06:57.520
If this... this next-generation version 
of western technology were to invade...

06:57.820 --> 07:01.020
It'd be the end! We're doomed!

07:01.020 --> 07:04.250
There's no need to panic! 
Calm yourself, Malcius!

07:04.940 --> 07:09.340
It's so over. We're all doomed.

07:12.150 --> 07:15.410
So that's what a western 
Cornev's take is on it?

07:15.410 --> 07:16.790
Fascinating.

07:18.290 --> 07:21.300
Crystal Helmet, glasses girl,

07:21.300 --> 07:25.250
I understand your inclination 
to fear unknown technology.

07:26.190 --> 07:27.470
Which is why...

07:30.300 --> 07:32.310
You should follow me.

07:32.310 --> 07:34.180
Wh-Where to?

07:38.510 --> 07:40.940
I want to show you our master.

07:41.820 --> 07:43.650
Your master? As in your teacher?

07:47.340 --> 07:49.320
Elder Balhath, where are we?

07:50.060 --> 07:52.560
This is holy ground for us Quefto.

07:59.910 --> 08:02.070
This is ancient super technology.

08:02.070 --> 08:04.270
The various Eugehvud.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.590
Eugehvud...

08:07.120 --> 08:09.960
In their language, it means 
"masterworks from another time."

08:11.610 --> 08:13.740
The willpower is generating 
incredible pressure...

08:13.740 --> 08:18.350
All I can say for certain 
is that this is amazing.

08:20.350 --> 08:25.090
What you see here remains largely 
undeciphered by us, as well.

08:25.540 --> 08:28.480
In the ancient past, when our 
people parted ways with the Ixt,

08:28.480 --> 08:32.010
they wandered until they found the 
cave underneath these mountains,

08:32.010 --> 08:34.650
where we began to dig our way around,

08:34.650 --> 08:37.390
eventually finding the furnace, 
along with these various artifacts.

08:37.390 --> 08:38.780
We have no idea what they're made of,

08:38.780 --> 08:41.270
and because they seem to 
be charged with willpower,

08:41.270 --> 08:43.480
we can't even chip away at them.

08:43.480 --> 08:47.220
They are signs that they've been 
enchanted to an incredible degree.

08:47.220 --> 08:49.510
These ancient masterworks...

08:49.510 --> 08:53.910
Our ancestors, our brothers 
and sisters, our progeny,

08:53.910 --> 08:57.270
before learning how to speak, 
desire to understand them.

08:57.490 --> 09:03.940
The desire to understand this avatar of 
knowledge forms every fiber of our beings!

09:04.320 --> 09:07.360
It's the foundation for your technology...

09:07.360 --> 09:09.150
which is why you called it your master.

09:10.560 --> 09:15.050
Grandpa, you're overcomplicating it.

09:15.050 --> 09:16.410
Kimaki?

09:17.160 --> 09:22.650
When we look at this stuff, 
to put it as bluntly as possible...

09:23.670 --> 09:28.050
Isn't it the coolest 
thing you've ever seen?!

09:28.350 --> 09:30.920
C-Cool...?

09:30.920 --> 09:32.300
Bingo!

09:32.300 --> 09:37.920
Cool is... how you'd describe 
such advanced technology?

09:38.420 --> 09:42.310
I mean, it certainly 
is striking to look at.

09:44.140 --> 09:46.820
I mean, who can argue with 
the fact that it's cool?

09:50.660 --> 09:55.150
Come to think of it, when I met 
the various tribes' elders,

09:55.150 --> 09:57.950
they mentioned having no interest 
in Cornem territorial disputes...

09:57.950 --> 10:00.680
I mean, look at what we've got here!

10:00.680 --> 10:02.860
It's way more appealing 
to go digging around

10:02.860 --> 10:05.830
in unknown technology than get 
mixed up in someone else's fight.

10:06.290 --> 10:10.960
Did that ease your worries a bit?

10:12.720 --> 10:20.220
That said, if the squabbling between the 
Cornem grows to include our mountain...

10:21.880 --> 10:25.940
That'll be the perfect chance 
for some field tests!

10:25.940 --> 10:29.290
Couldn't ask for a better 
way to gather data!

10:32.340 --> 10:34.860
R-Right...

10:35.430 --> 10:40.850
I think if I do return home, 
I won't mention dwarves being real.

10:55.500 --> 10:58.100
Miss Sera! Over here!

11:01.280 --> 11:04.820
This is my favorite:
the jet-black colossus!

11:06.350 --> 11:08.790
He's the most handsome of them all,

11:08.790 --> 11:12.230
and when you get his attention, 
he looks your way!

11:14.360 --> 11:15.790
That's terrifying!

11:15.790 --> 11:18.730
It's giving off such willpower 
pressure, it's making me nauseous!

11:20.460 --> 11:22.160
Malcius!

11:22.870 --> 11:24.250
It's okay.

11:24.870 --> 11:28.410
Like Grandpa said, 
we're still studying it.

11:28.410 --> 11:31.250
We have no idea how to get it moving.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.750
That's even scarier!

11:32.970 --> 11:38.760
Well, as you've seen, the Eugehvud 
are all built around willpower.

11:40.250 --> 11:44.190
Miss Sera, would you like to 
come and study them with us?!

11:44.190 --> 11:48.020
No one in the city has willpower 
like the two of you!

11:48.460 --> 11:54.480
And they seem to be built for people 
as tall as Cornem and Ixt, anyway!

11:56.200 --> 12:01.100
I appreciate the offer, 
but I have a lot left undone.

12:01.100 --> 12:04.040
I can't afford to stay here for long.

12:04.580 --> 12:06.300
Really?

12:06.300 --> 12:07.290
I'm sorry.

12:07.290 --> 12:09.330
Don't worry about it.

12:14.800 --> 12:17.370
We were finally able to put her down.

12:17.830 --> 12:22.470
How much can one one person faint? 
Crazy cult woman.

12:22.470 --> 12:25.220
Let's have her rest until morning.

12:25.760 --> 12:28.190
We're sorry to trouble you.

12:28.680 --> 12:30.540
It's no trouble at all.

12:30.540 --> 12:33.580
Especially after getting to see that 
fine armor of yours, Crystal Helmet.

12:34.900 --> 12:37.690
That reminds me, can I ask you something?

12:38.820 --> 12:40.700
Of course. What is it?

12:40.940 --> 12:45.070
Everyone calls you 
Crystal Helmet, Miss Sera...

12:46.000 --> 12:48.710
Did you really have a helmet 
made of crystal?!

12:49.200 --> 12:53.460
Well, until it was broken 
in my duel with Veor...

12:53.710 --> 12:57.060
In the west, you mostly 
use iron or steel, right?

12:57.060 --> 12:59.180
What material was used at 
the seams for the crystal?

12:59.180 --> 13:00.800
How thick was the crystal?

13:00.800 --> 13:02.590
Did you use a particular 
method for polishing it?

13:02.590 --> 13:04.110
How did you measure its transparency?

13:04.840 --> 13:06.940
W-Wait a moment, Kimaki.

13:08.750 --> 13:11.820
I hate to disappoint you, 
but I'm a knight.

13:11.820 --> 13:14.480
Metallurgy and metalworking are 
not in my field of knowledge.

13:14.480 --> 13:17.480
Oh, I'm sorry.

13:17.480 --> 13:19.280
If you don't mind the 
fact that it's broken,

13:19.280 --> 13:21.990
the helmet is at Master Veor's house.

13:22.880 --> 13:24.330
Really?!

13:24.330 --> 13:27.370
Yeah. If you ever come visit, 
you're free to look at it.

13:27.770 --> 13:31.370
Hey, Kimaki! 
The bosses are calling for you!

13:31.370 --> 13:33.960
I'm on my way!

13:33.960 --> 13:36.380
Sorry to cut our conversation short.

13:36.910 --> 13:39.130
Oh, don't worry about it.

13:39.130 --> 13:42.380
You've already done so 
much to help us out.

13:42.620 --> 13:45.400
Well, I'll come see you again tomorrow.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.460
In the meantime, 
make sure to get some rest.

13:50.890 --> 13:53.700
I guess we should head to bed, as well.

14:04.330 --> 14:08.640
Wh-What is that?! Were those 
an angel's trumpets?!

14:08.640 --> 14:10.120
Is it the end of the world?!

14:11.850 --> 14:15.390
Good morning, ladies.

14:15.390 --> 14:17.340
That voice... Kimaki!

14:17.340 --> 14:18.980
What was that noise from before?

14:20.070 --> 14:22.990
Sorry if it scared you.

14:22.990 --> 14:24.580
That was the morning whistle:

14:24.580 --> 14:27.410
our sign that the furnace is 
ready for us to get to work.

14:27.780 --> 14:30.770
It heats up every day 
without us doing a thing!

14:31.430 --> 14:34.390
The morning whistle... Then it's morning?

14:41.070 --> 14:43.610
How can you tell...?

14:43.610 --> 14:46.660
Everyone from the outside 
asks the same question.

14:55.140 --> 14:59.290
Well, we got what we came for, 
and now with breakfast done...

14:59.540 --> 15:03.170
Right. It's nearly time 
for us to take our leave.

15:03.170 --> 15:08.800
What an experience! I'd love to try 
those hot springs out in the winter.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.680
More mixed bathing, eh?

15:11.680 --> 15:14.480
I-I didn't mean it that way!

15:14.480 --> 15:19.540
It's those changing rooms that were 
confusing! I didn't mean to...

15:19.880 --> 15:21.440
Actually...

15:22.990 --> 15:27.450
If the actual baths are mixed anyway, 
why are there separate changing rooms?

15:29.110 --> 15:34.700
Miss Sera, that's... 
a cultural thing for us.

15:34.700 --> 15:36.210
It is?

15:36.210 --> 15:43.180
Well, to simplify it, 
for Quefto, undressing is an...

15:43.180 --> 15:47.600
invitation to... that sort of thing.

15:48.470 --> 15:52.470
But the mixed bathing is fine?

15:52.740 --> 15:57.660
I mean, you're just cleaning up. 
What's there to be embarrassed about?

15:58.150 --> 15:59.850
I see.

16:00.390 --> 16:03.660
I have something to tell you, too!

16:04.650 --> 16:11.130
I actually get to join 
you at your village!

16:13.380 --> 16:15.690
I already got permission 
from Sir Thundering Voice.

16:16.270 --> 16:19.750
That seems like a sudden decision, Kimaki.

16:19.990 --> 16:25.120
Well, the thing is, after we went 
our separate ways yesterday...

16:26.670 --> 16:29.380
You want me to move to 
the Lakeside Village?

16:29.600 --> 16:36.140
Well, now that the wifey has her Quefto 
gear, someone's gotta maintain it.

16:36.140 --> 16:39.890
Can't just hand it over 
and act like that's that.

16:40.480 --> 16:44.400
But this is so sudden... 
What about my studies?

16:44.400 --> 16:47.640
Come off it. Ain't like the 
ancestor's legacy is gonna run off.

16:47.640 --> 16:51.750
It's been ages of studying that 
stuff with barely any progress.

16:51.750 --> 16:54.670
A year or two won't make much difference.

16:56.360 --> 16:57.410
Kimaki.

16:58.010 --> 16:59.660
Grandpa...

16:59.660 --> 17:03.670
Our curiosity doesn't end 
at the city's borders.

17:05.920 --> 17:08.940
There's bound to be technology 
and culture in the west

17:08.940 --> 17:11.500
that would never occur to us.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.680
Just like this armor.

17:13.680 --> 17:16.510
I've heard you were curious 
about the crystal helmet

17:16.510 --> 17:19.040
that was made in the west, as well.

17:19.780 --> 17:22.280
Cornem live such short lives.

17:22.750 --> 17:26.730
Compared to the inheritance 
from our progenitors,

17:26.730 --> 17:30.450
that've existed for millennia, our time 
with them will be over in an instant.

17:32.950 --> 17:36.220
If you don't mind, why not 
spend some time there?

17:36.220 --> 17:39.660
If you've taken a liking to 
Thundering Voice and Crystal Helmet,

17:39.660 --> 17:42.480
this might be a once-in-a-lifetime 
opportunity.

17:43.580 --> 17:46.850
I see. Sorry for the trouble.

17:48.400 --> 17:50.840
Well, I might be curious 
about the legacy tech,

17:50.840 --> 17:55.500
but spending time with you 
all seems... fun, too.

17:55.500 --> 17:58.720
Plus, I'll get to see the 
actual crystal helmet!

18:00.730 --> 18:03.230
Oh, and don't worry.

18:04.560 --> 18:10.580
I'll be living in the village, so you 
two won't have any... interruptions.

18:10.580 --> 18:12.000
Interruptions?!

18:12.000 --> 18:15.370
Now, hold on, Veor and I haven't 
done anything like that yet!

18:15.660 --> 18:18.700
That "yet" makes me think 
it's a matter of time.

18:19.200 --> 18:22.190
I-I can see why, but...

18:22.600 --> 18:26.780
I guess you're not aware of the 
strange position I'm in, Kimaki.

18:27.530 --> 18:30.510
What strange position?

18:30.510 --> 18:33.050
Well, the thing is...

18:33.050 --> 18:34.260
Kimaki!

18:34.260 --> 18:37.330
Big trouble, Kimaki! 
And Sir Thundering Voice's party!

18:37.760 --> 18:40.470
We've got ourselves a sticky situation!

18:40.470 --> 18:44.390
The outside surveillance 
team had some nasty news!

18:44.630 --> 18:49.540
The Guren Nairi that attacked 
yesterday is still outside, waiting!

18:52.830 --> 18:55.480
I'd wager it's after us.

18:57.130 --> 19:00.400
This certainly doesn't 
happen to the Quefto often.

19:00.400 --> 19:04.160
So if there's a cause, 
it's likely to be our visit.

19:04.160 --> 19:07.600
I-Is there another exit we could 
use, away from the fire dragon?

19:07.600 --> 19:08.790
Unfortunately, it wouldn't matter.

19:09.910 --> 19:12.040
As a true dragon, Guren Nairi have

19:12.040 --> 19:15.600
the troublesome ability to use 
willpower with great skill.

19:16.680 --> 19:18.680
That includes its fire breath

19:18.890 --> 19:25.560
and and ability to detect my 
dragon image from a distance.

19:26.020 --> 19:28.450
It already came this 
far down the mountain.

19:28.780 --> 19:32.570
I imagine if we went to the far 
side, it would simply come after us.

19:34.190 --> 19:36.590
Well, in that case...

19:37.070 --> 19:41.080
I'm forced to say that 
I welcome the challenge!

19:41.080 --> 19:45.230
Y-Y-You what?! 
Lady Serafina, don't tell me...

19:45.230 --> 19:47.830
Indeed. Sharp of you to notice, Malcius.

19:49.000 --> 19:53.840
If we cannot avoid this battle, 
then I, Serafina de Lavillant,

19:53.840 --> 19:57.170
have no intention on shirking from 
it, as any good knight would!

19:58.590 --> 20:03.120
Sh-She just wants to test out 
her new helmet, doesn't she?!

20:05.350 --> 20:07.630
Where's the overpressure ammunition?

20:07.630 --> 20:10.860
The western warehouse! Do we have 
enough stretchers and bandages?

20:17.740 --> 20:20.490
Flash and smoke grenades! 
Bring 'em over here!

20:20.710 --> 20:23.170
Load the tunnels up with them!

20:25.250 --> 20:27.750
Anti-dragon guns, all checked!

20:27.750 --> 20:30.260
Load up the anti-flying dragon rounds!

20:30.260 --> 20:32.520
We'll be using these net 
guns for the first time!

20:32.650 --> 20:35.780
This has turned into a bigger 
commotion than I thought...

20:35.780 --> 20:40.740
Hunts and battles are a chance to 
put our technology to the test.

20:40.740 --> 20:42.640
Everyone gets fired up about it!

20:43.200 --> 20:46.390
I don't suppose there's a chance 
we won't need to get involved...

20:46.390 --> 20:48.270
That won't be the case.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.630
He's right.

20:49.630 --> 20:53.060
These projectiles move faster 
than the eye can see,

20:53.060 --> 20:54.910
so you can't imbue them with willpower.

20:54.910 --> 20:56.780
Best-case scenario, 
they can act as a deterrent!

20:58.830 --> 21:01.480
The only effective offense and defense

21:01.480 --> 21:05.030
against a fire dragon requires willpower.

21:05.880 --> 21:10.430
Then the support of the Quefto should 
only be considered a tactical option.

21:11.040 --> 21:13.650
They're twitching a bunch, again!

21:13.650 --> 21:15.630
We need to prepare, as well.

21:15.630 --> 21:18.800
We face a fire dragon! There 
could be no better opponent!

21:18.800 --> 21:24.220
E-Even if we can't avoid it, 
can't we be a more careful?

21:27.260 --> 21:29.590
According to the periodic 
report from 30 minutes ago,

21:29.590 --> 21:32.560
the Guren Nairi is waiting 
near the exit to tunnel 4.

21:32.560 --> 21:35.360
The other exits open out 
to wide open spaces,

21:35.360 --> 21:38.080
so this is the best spot to 
deploy our hunters, as well.

21:38.500 --> 21:42.220
